# Clean-room protection: never commit original game binaries, patched .win files, or game assets
/local/*
!/local/README.md
!/local/README.zh-CN.md
**/runtime/
**/runtime-*/
*.win
*.exe
*.dll
*.dat
*.sav
*.nsf
*.ogg
*.wav
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.xdelta
*.bps
/Music/
/SFX/
*Wallpaper*.jpg
*Wallpaper*.png
*-QA.png

# .NET build & IDE artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.idea/

# Logs & temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
